    <p class="eyebrow">Site</p>
    <h1>Accessibility</h1>
    <p>This site is built to meet WCAG 2.1 AA: every page works with a keyboard alone, images that carry meaning have text alternatives, colour contrast is checked against the paper and leather backgrounds, text can be resized, and motion (including the opening book) is turned off when your system asks for reduced motion. If something on the site is hard to use, please <a href="/#contact">write to Courtney</a> and say which page and what went wrong; it will be fixed.</p>
